## Why This Is Asked
Evaluates ability to design safe, scalable canary rollouts for multi-tenant LLM gateways, balancing SLA guarantees, data locality, and observability.

## Key Concepts
- Canary rollout stages and metrics
- Per-tenant isolation and hot-swapping
- SLA-driven rollback and drift detection
- Region-aware routing and audits

## Code Example
```javascript
function canaryRoute(tenant, versionMap){
  // pseudo routing logic
  const stage = tenant.stage;
  const v = versionMap[stage] || versionMap.full;
  return {tenant, version: v};
}
```

